00:01:32.246 --> 00:01:35.584
=Flying Up Without Disturb=

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.976
=Episode 3=

00:01:44.819 --> 00:01:45.419
Young Master.

00:01:53.979 --> 00:01:54.619
Young Master.

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:55.459
Didn't you

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:56.300
just take medicine?

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.539
Why are you taking it again?

00:01:58.020 --> 00:01:58.860
The medicine

00:01:58.860 --> 00:01:59.660
isn't working?

00:02:00.539 --> 00:02:01.380
I'll tell Master.

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.459
He must have a solution.

00:02:02.819 --> 00:02:04.020
Don't disturb Master.

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:04.699
But...

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.220
I'll feel better soon.

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:10.819
This makes no sense.

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.060
Luanfeng Peak brims
with spiritual energy.

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:14.900
Why do I feel worse

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.340
after meditating?

00:02:18.539 --> 00:02:20.100
Could it be that only she...?

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:23.620
Right!

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.660
Dress.

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.539
(It's Liuguang Sect again?)

00:02:40.579 --> 00:02:42.100
(It's haunting me!)

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.699
All packed up?

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:00.259
Master.

00:03:00.259 --> 00:03:01.380
It's all set now.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:02.460
I'll set off

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:03.900
tomorrow morning.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.699
Leaving in such a hurry?

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:12.940
Master.

00:03:13.139 --> 00:03:14.940
I don't want to leave.

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:16.819
If so,

00:03:16.819 --> 00:03:19.660
stay and keep me company.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.100
Master!

00:03:24.739 --> 00:03:26.940
I'm just kidding.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:28.739
I understand

00:03:28.859 --> 00:03:31.699
you need to see
Lingyou Realm's splendor,

00:03:31.699 --> 00:03:32.739
experience customs,

00:03:32.739 --> 00:03:34.739
make friends,

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:35.500
and observe

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.620
how other sects operate.

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.340
This will temper your character

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:42.500
and aid your cultivation.

00:03:44.299 --> 00:03:46.019
But before you depart,

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:47.819
I have two crucial suggestions

00:03:47.819 --> 00:03:48.739
for you.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:50.620
First,

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:52.019
when traveling,

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.220
never overextend yourself.

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:55.340
If you can't win,

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:57.620
fleeing is the wisest choice.

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:00.979
Understood. I'll flee when needed.

00:04:01.139 --> 00:04:02.139
Second,

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.100
the most vital suggestion.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:07.139
Come.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:10.060
Sit here.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.460
To prevent you from recklessly

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.340
absorbing spiritual energy outside,

00:04:18.419 --> 00:04:19.340
I must

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.299
seal key acupoints in your body.

00:04:22.979 --> 00:04:24.820
Must you, Master?

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.299
If you refuse,

00:04:26.299 --> 00:04:27.340
how could I let you

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:28.780
venture out unprepared?

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.499
Besides, who else would shield you

00:04:30.499 --> 00:04:32.820
from thunder strikes
like me and your senior brothers?

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:35.379
I see.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.340
I agree.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:59.700
They know Kong Hou attracts lightning,

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.299
yet those Liuguang Sect members

00:05:01.299 --> 00:05:02.379
still stubbornly

00:05:02.379 --> 00:05:04.220
cling to her shamelessly!

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:04.820
Well...

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:07.979
Don't lay a finger

00:05:07.979 --> 00:05:08.939
on Kong Hou!

00:05:13.107 --> 00:05:15.456
(Tian Yuan)

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:33.939
Young Master.

00:05:34.379 --> 00:05:35.299
Kong Hou

00:05:35.299 --> 00:05:36.539
hasn't answered your message?

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:38.100
Do you think

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.340
something happened to her?

00:05:39.619 --> 00:05:41.100
What could happen to her?

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:41.939
Young Master.

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:42.979
You should focus on

00:05:42.979 --> 00:05:44.260
healing your injury.

00:05:44.419 --> 00:05:45.140
If not for her,

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:45.900
with your strength,

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:47.379
you wouldn't have been hurt by Jiusu.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:49.619
If your injury isn't treated,

00:05:49.619 --> 00:05:50.820
it'll hinder your ascension.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:51.780
Then...

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.100
Well...

00:05:56.859 --> 00:05:58.260
Never mind.

00:05:58.619 --> 00:05:59.820
I was joking.

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:01.419
Young Master. Don't take it seriously.

00:06:01.539 --> 00:06:02.820
But you're right.

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:04.419
Given her temperament,

00:06:04.539 --> 00:06:05.499
she might cause trouble

00:06:05.619 --> 00:06:06.859
within the sect.

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:08.419
Oh please!

00:06:08.419 --> 00:06:10.140
You're clearly worried about her.

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:11.660
I first met her

00:06:11.739 --> 00:06:13.460
in the Forbidden Forest of Yunhua Sect.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.460
Within her sect territory.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.539
But the Yunhua Sect

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.460
must have multiple dangerous areas.

00:06:19.539 --> 00:06:20.859
Young Master.

00:06:20.979 --> 00:06:22.419
Have you even been listening to me?

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:23.340
Enough.

00:06:23.539 --> 00:06:25.499
You go check Yunhua Sect now.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:27.660
I go to Yunhua Sect?

00:06:28.359 --> 00:06:28.859
Why...

00:06:28.859 --> 00:06:30.020
Why should I?

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:30.979
Go check

00:06:30.979 --> 00:06:32.619
if she returned safely.

00:06:32.739 --> 00:06:33.580
Wait,

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:34.739
she might've just been

00:06:34.739 --> 00:06:36.539
too busy to reply to your message.

00:06:36.539 --> 00:06:37.499
Or she's hanging out

00:06:37.499 --> 00:06:38.619
and forgets to respond.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:41.299
I'll go.

00:06:42.675 --> 00:06:44.736
(Yunhua Sect)

00:06:55.539 --> 00:06:58.660
It's time to say goodbye.

00:06:58.859 --> 00:06:59.619
Off you go.

00:07:02.059 --> 00:07:03.179
Oh, Kong Hou.

00:07:04.059 --> 00:07:04.820
Master.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.100
I've already taught you

00:07:10.179 --> 00:07:12.539
how to use these magical tools before.

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:14.140
Remember it well.

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.299
If danger comes,

00:07:15.299 --> 00:07:17.499
protect yourself at all costs.

00:07:17.939 --> 00:07:19.660
I'll remember, Master.

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:20.539
Good.

00:07:20.539 --> 00:07:21.780
That's good.

00:07:21.939 --> 00:07:22.739
Kong Hou.

00:07:22.859 --> 00:07:23.979
Kong Hou.

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:24.979
Tan Feng.

00:07:24.999 --> 00:07:25.499
Ling Hui.

00:07:25.499 --> 00:07:26.179
Kong Hou.

00:07:26.979 --> 00:07:27.700
Kong Hou.

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.660
We pooled these spirit stones for you.

00:07:29.739 --> 00:07:30.499
Take them.

00:07:31.379 --> 00:07:32.820
This is so touching!

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:34.820
Kong Hou is still so young.

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:35.539
How could you

00:07:35.539 --> 00:07:36.739
let her go on a solo journey?

00:07:37.299 --> 00:07:38.780
What if she gets hurt?

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:39.859
Kong Hou.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.820
When I earn enough spirit stones,
I'll come find you.

00:07:42.979 --> 00:07:43.660
Deal.

00:07:43.979 --> 00:07:45.739
Take care of yourself, Kong Hou.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:47.460
Send us messages often.

00:07:47.499 --> 00:07:48.900
Don't worry.

00:07:48.939 --> 00:07:50.100
I definitely will.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.460
It's getting late.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:52.580
Time to depart.

00:07:52.939 --> 00:07:54.020
Master.

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:55.859
I'm leaving now.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:22.900
Ouch!

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:24.780
It hurts!

00:08:25.299 --> 00:08:26.820
Liuguang Sect's techniques.

00:08:26.859 --> 00:08:28.260
What are you to Liuguang Sect?

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:28.780
Senior.

00:08:28.859 --> 00:08:30.460
I'm Lin Hu from Liuguang Sect,

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:31.419
sent by my young master

00:08:31.419 --> 00:08:32.899
to find Kong Hou.

00:08:33.779 --> 00:08:34.580
Ouch!

00:08:34.619 --> 00:08:35.580
Your young master?

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.460
The one Kong Hou met
in the Forbidden Forest?

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:38.540
Yes, exactly!

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:40.060
Ouch!

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:40.940
Alright.

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:41.460
Ease up!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.019
I haven't even gone looking for you,

00:08:43.019 --> 00:08:44.820
yet you dare show up here.

00:08:45.139 --> 00:08:45.700
Exactly!

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:46.499
Looking for us?

00:08:46.499 --> 00:08:47.220
Why?

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.180
Let me make this clear.

00:08:48.859 --> 00:08:50.899
Kong Hou has left for her journey.

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.420
Stop bothering her!

00:08:52.499 --> 00:08:53.060
She has left?

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:53.820
One more thing,

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:55.100
don't even

00:08:55.139 --> 00:08:56.460
mention your young master again!

00:08:56.499 --> 00:08:57.619
I haven't met him yet,

00:08:57.619 --> 00:08:58.420
but if I do,

00:08:58.460 --> 00:08:59.820
I'll definitely punch him!

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:00.779
Senior,

00:09:00.899 --> 00:09:02.460
don't think you can bully us

00:09:02.619 --> 00:09:03.580
just because you're old!

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:04.379
My young master

00:09:04.379 --> 00:09:05.540
is concerned about Kong Hou,

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.139
so he sent me to check on her.

00:09:07.139 --> 00:09:08.019
He's concerned?

00:09:08.019 --> 00:09:09.259
Why didn't he come then?

00:09:09.259 --> 00:09:10.060
Sending you instead?

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:10.580
I...

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:12.379
And you keep

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:14.100
calling him "young master."

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:15.779
Who is he at Liuguang Sect?

00:09:15.859 --> 00:09:16.659
How arrogant he is!

00:09:16.779 --> 00:09:18.499
He won't even tell us his name.

00:09:18.499 --> 00:09:19.499
I...

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:20.739
Don't say anything.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:22.499
Are you spouting nonsense,

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.700
pretending to be from Liuguang Sect?

00:09:24.739 --> 00:09:26.540
Old man, stop your nonsense!

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:27.460
Our Liuguang Sect

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:28.580
would never do such things.

00:09:28.739 --> 00:09:30.139
I can't say my young master's name

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:30.739
because...

00:09:30.739 --> 00:09:31.899
Because of what?

00:09:31.899 --> 00:09:32.779
Because...

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:34.659
I just can't say it!

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:35.220
Never mind.

00:09:35.259 --> 00:09:36.899
You don't need to explain.

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:40.619
I'm going to teach you a lesson
right now!

00:09:42.139 --> 00:09:43.979
Old man, you hit me!

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:45.659
Listen up!

00:09:45.779 --> 00:09:47.499
The reason

00:09:47.499 --> 00:09:48.460
Kong Hou was

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:49.940
with your young master

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:50.580
was simply

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:52.139
to enhance her spiritual energy

00:09:52.139 --> 00:09:53.259
and awaken her natal weapon.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:54.859
She wanted to leave sooner.

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:56.300
And now she's already

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:57.700
gone for her trials!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.379
Why would she
need your young master now?

00:09:59.659 --> 00:10:01.100
Who do you think you are?

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:04.019
Don't think
your young master is delightful.

00:10:04.019 --> 00:10:05.965
(Tian Yuan)

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:18.499
You're back.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.859
How did it go?

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:27.739
Why are you looking down?

00:10:27.739 --> 00:10:28.739
I'm talking to you.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:33.340
Young Master, I was beaten up!

00:10:34.739 --> 00:10:35.540
Her master got mad

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:36.619
when he heard you sent me.

00:10:36.619 --> 00:10:37.619
She left for her trials,

00:10:37.619 --> 00:10:38.700
and her master beat me.

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:40.100
How can you still

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:41.619
focus on writing books?

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:44.420
This proves

00:10:44.779 --> 00:10:46.659
her cultivation has improved.

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:47.580
Good news.

00:10:47.659 --> 00:10:48.899
Her wish is fulfilled.

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:51.100
Young Master, this is urgent!

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:52.739
Why are you still worrying about her?

00:10:52.779 --> 00:10:54.859
We've been deceived!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.379
What nonsense!

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:58.540
It's true!

00:10:58.540 --> 00:10:59.139
I swear!

00:10:59.139 --> 00:11:00.460
Her master said it himself!

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:01.379
Listen up!

00:11:01.379 --> 00:11:02.820
The reason

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:04.259
Kong Hou was with your young master

00:11:04.259 --> 00:11:05.979
was simply

00:11:06.019 --> 00:11:07.820
to enhance her spiritual energy

00:11:07.820 --> 00:11:09.659
and awaken her natal weapon.

00:11:09.779 --> 00:11:10.979
I initially thought

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:12.739
she helped you regulate energy

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:14.180
for your health,

00:11:14.259 --> 00:11:15.540
but now I realize

00:11:15.739 --> 00:11:16.739
she just wanted you

00:11:16.739 --> 00:11:18.499
to help her
enhance her spiritual energy.

00:11:18.979 --> 00:11:21.139
(It's alright. As long as she's safe.)

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.220
(Then it's time for me to depart.)

00:11:23.987 --> 00:11:26.528
(Yuan City)

00:11:32.899 --> 00:11:34.300
He is dead!

00:11:34.779 --> 00:11:35.779
He's dead!

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:36.779
Dead!

00:11:37.659 --> 00:11:38.379
Dead!

00:11:38.379 --> 00:11:39.499
What happened up ahead?

00:11:39.739 --> 00:11:40.659
Make way!

00:11:40.739 --> 00:11:41.379
Let me through!

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:45.499
Look, he's dead!

00:11:53.888 --> 00:11:54.779
Let's go take a look.

00:11:55.779 --> 00:11:57.300
What did he eat earlier?

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:58.820
This is it.

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.300
Just burdock root.

00:12:00.499 --> 00:12:02.100
We ate this all the time as kids.

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:03.540
Never had problems.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.820
Burdock root? Nonsense!

00:12:10.019 --> 00:12:11.180
This is toxic wood!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.340
Though similar to burdock root,

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.379
it's highly poisonous.

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:16.180
Poisonous!

00:12:16.899 --> 00:12:19.060
If mortals eat this,

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.659
toxins will rage through their veins.

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:22.700
They will die.

00:12:22.979 --> 00:12:23.979
It's surprising

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:26.859
to find someone here who knows this.

00:12:26.859 --> 00:12:28.180
Just know a little about it.

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:29.580
Young Master.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.139
Isn't he dead?

00:12:31.259 --> 00:12:32.259
You don't understand.

00:12:32.379 --> 00:12:33.460
If I can extract

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:34.619
the toxins from his body,

00:12:34.659 --> 00:12:35.700
he can be revived.

00:12:35.739 --> 00:12:36.979
You can extract the toxins?

00:12:37.019 --> 00:12:38.460
I've never heard

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:39.779
that cultivators and healers

00:12:39.779 --> 00:12:40.899
can do such things.

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:46.100
Young Master.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.300
Why is this guy so cryptic?

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:49.619
I think he's probably

00:12:49.619 --> 00:12:50.460
locating the poison

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:51.619
through acupoint analysis.

00:12:51.619 --> 00:12:52.420
You guessed right.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.100
He's alive!

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:01.899
He's alive!

00:13:01.979 --> 00:13:03.060
What an amazing physician!

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:03.979
Very impressive.

00:13:03.979 --> 00:13:05.139
Thank you, sir.

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.019
Thank you, sir.

00:13:06.139 --> 00:13:07.100
Everyone, disperse now.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.540
What an amazing physician!

00:13:08.739 --> 00:13:09.820
Senior, please wait!

00:13:11.259 --> 00:13:12.100
Let's go.

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:14.700
What can I do for you?

00:13:14.779 --> 00:13:16.859
I've traveled
through Lingyou Realm for years

00:13:17.019 --> 00:13:18.420
and seen many things.

00:13:18.779 --> 00:13:19.979
But I've never seen

00:13:19.979 --> 00:13:21.779
such unfathomable medical skills.

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:22.899
Indeed.

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:24.979
May we have your name?

00:13:24.979 --> 00:13:26.060
It's our honor to know you.

00:13:26.659 --> 00:13:28.019
My name

00:13:28.019 --> 00:13:29.019
carries weight.

00:13:29.139 --> 00:13:30.979
A mere Nascent Soul cultivator

00:13:30.979 --> 00:13:31.859
isn't worthy to ask.

00:13:32.379 --> 00:13:32.899
What?

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:35.060
You can actually
discern my cultivation level?

00:13:35.899 --> 00:13:37.700
Speak your purpose quickly.

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:39.700
I'm severely injured.

00:13:39.979 --> 00:13:41.659
I beg for your healing.

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:45.739
I can't even

00:13:46.499 --> 00:13:48.019
perceive his cultivation level.

00:13:50.979 --> 00:13:52.259
I won't treat you.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:53.859
Old man.

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.220
This guy is really...

00:14:05.979 --> 00:14:07.300
Young Master.

00:14:07.619 --> 00:14:08.820
You mean

00:14:09.019 --> 00:14:10.139
that old man

00:14:10.139 --> 00:14:11.340
is Master Huang Qi?

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:12.899
In today's Lingyou Realm,

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:15.139
the only one

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:17.580
whose medical skills are that incredible

00:14:17.899 --> 00:14:19.060
must be him.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.460
Then why did he

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:21.739
refuse to treat you?

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:23.019
How should I know?

00:14:25.899 --> 00:14:26.580
Look,

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:28.259
that old man won't treat you.

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.379
Kong Hou won't help you

00:14:29.379 --> 00:14:30.580
with your energy regulation.

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:31.779
What do we do now?

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:34.100
Who's there?

00:14:37.619 --> 00:14:38.420
What a coincidence!

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:39.540
It really is you guys.

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.859
Why is it you again?

00:14:40.979 --> 00:14:41.940
I overheard you seeking

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:42.700
Master Huang Qi.

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:44.300
Is it because your poison

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:45.019
still lingers?

00:14:45.019 --> 00:14:46.460
Let me take you to see him.

00:14:46.859 --> 00:14:48.340
Master Huang Qi

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:49.940
refused to treat me.

00:14:50.379 --> 00:14:51.940
That old man was utterly arrogant.

00:14:52.019 --> 00:14:53.499
He just refused directly.

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:57.060
He won't treat you?

00:14:58.060 --> 00:14:58.940
But don't worry.

00:14:58.940 --> 00:14:59.739
I've got a plan.

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:01.100
I'll take you there.

00:15:01.619 --> 00:15:03.300
What's wrong today?

00:15:03.779 --> 00:15:04.580
Seeing all these

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:06.180
little trinkets around,

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:07.379
you don't even want to buy.

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:09.460
Actually, I just...

00:15:12.499 --> 00:15:14.300
Master, what's wrong?

00:15:14.739 --> 00:15:16.139
Having stomach issues again?

00:15:16.139 --> 00:15:16.979
Master.

00:15:17.019 --> 00:15:18.820
You've got a run all day.

00:15:18.859 --> 00:15:21.060
Let's find a physician.

00:15:21.979 --> 00:15:23.060
Just diarrhea.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.259
No need to see physicians.

00:15:24.259 --> 00:15:25.300
Later, I'll get some pills

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:26.019
from Huang Qi.

00:15:26.019 --> 00:15:26.540
I'll be fine.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:27.300
Huang Qi?

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.100
Wait.

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:29.220
What now?

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:30.060
Huang Qi?

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.060
The so-called greatest physician,

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:33.499
Master Huang Qi?

00:15:33.659 --> 00:15:35.019
Greatest Physician?

00:15:35.019 --> 00:15:36.019
My foot!

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:37.060
He's just

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.220
a cranky old man.

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:38.779
That's all.

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:39.859
Wait.

00:15:40.139 --> 00:15:41.779
- What now?
- Master.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:43.100
I've heard rumors

00:15:43.139 --> 00:15:44.259
that Master Huang Qi

00:15:44.259 --> 00:15:45.820
enjoys traveling widely.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.739
His whereabouts are elusive.

00:15:47.979 --> 00:15:48.700
How do you know

00:15:48.739 --> 00:15:49.700
where he lives?

00:15:50.619 --> 00:15:52.739
I saw him just days ago.

00:15:52.779 --> 00:15:54.580
He's been wandering around Yuan City.

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:56.379
I arranged his accommodations myself.

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:57.859
You have a way?

00:15:58.340 --> 00:15:59.499
What's your plan?

00:16:00.019 --> 00:16:00.899
However,

00:16:00.899 --> 00:16:01.940
it is

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:02.820
getting dark now.

00:16:02.859 --> 00:16:03.859
Master Huang Qi

00:16:03.859 --> 00:16:05.220
has an eccentric temperament.

00:16:05.379 --> 00:16:05.979
If we visit him

00:16:05.979 --> 00:16:07.499
in the dead of night,

00:16:07.499 --> 00:16:08.540
we might anger him.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:09.580
That'd be unfortunate.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:16.899
Is trusting me so difficult?

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:18.139
I genuinely have a way

00:16:18.139 --> 00:16:19.820
to meet Master Huang Qi.

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:21.859
Come with me tomorrow,

00:16:21.859 --> 00:16:22.899
and you'll know yourself.

00:16:47.499 --> 00:16:48.460
Hot.

00:16:54.619 --> 00:16:55.659
No need to rush.

00:16:56.019 --> 00:16:57.139
We won't take yours.

00:16:59.739 --> 00:17:00.739
Want some?

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:01.820
It's delicious.

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.100
Eat while it's hot.

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:03.979
In your mouth,

00:17:04.019 --> 00:17:05.379
it'll melt instantly.

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:06.859
I'm fasting.

00:17:07.899 --> 00:17:08.699
Oh right.

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:09.859
I forgot.

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:11.980
Want some?

00:17:12.139 --> 00:17:13.060
No need.

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:13.780
Thank you.

00:17:13.899 --> 00:17:14.780
I'm also fasting.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.020
By the way,

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:18.219
after knowing you this long,

00:17:18.219 --> 00:17:18.780
I still don't

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:19.899
know your name.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:27.540
I'm...

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.060
I'm Huan Zong.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.699
Huan Zong.

00:17:34.939 --> 00:17:36.219
That's a lovely name.

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:37.699
Enough.

00:17:37.899 --> 00:17:38.899
We're not that close.

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:40.100
Don't try to approach me.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:41.540
Go eat over there.

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.020
I'm going to meditate.

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:18.820
What are you doing?

00:18:23.419 --> 00:18:24.899
I just...

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.260
Don't be nervous.

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:27.780
I noticed you're injured.

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:29.580
Lean on my shoulder

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:30.100
to rest.

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:30.899
It'll be comfy.

00:18:34.899 --> 00:18:36.580
Don't tell me you suspect

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:38.419
I'll try to regulate your energy

00:18:38.659 --> 00:18:40.179
while you're asleep?

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:43.859
Relax.

00:18:43.939 --> 00:18:45.780
Our clothes separate us.

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:47.340
I can't absorb your energy.

00:18:47.419 --> 00:18:49.659
Direct skin contact
is required for that.

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:57.179
Never mind.

00:18:57.379 --> 00:18:58.580
I won't touch you.

00:19:02.219 --> 00:19:03.939
I'll just sit here.

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:18.100
I'm full.

00:19:18.419 --> 00:19:19.300
Going to sleep now.

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:00.459
Huan Zong, wake up!

00:20:00.459 --> 00:20:01.340
Something's happening.

00:20:02.139 --> 00:20:03.300
What is it?

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:04.619
Look over there!

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:23.699
Blue Silver Flowers!

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:25.419
I thought

00:20:25.419 --> 00:20:26.619
it was some fearsome beast.

00:20:26.619 --> 00:20:28.020
Just some flowers?

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:28.980
The glowing blue field

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:30.020
looks rather beautiful.

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:44.020
Not fast enough.

00:20:44.179 --> 00:20:44.859
Again.

00:20:50.419 --> 00:20:51.300
Not fast enough.

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:52.459
Still not fast enough.

00:20:56.179 --> 00:20:57.020
Listen well.

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:58.699
If your sword strikes

00:20:58.939 --> 00:20:59.859
aren't faster

00:20:59.859 --> 00:21:01.139
than these flowers' death rate,

00:21:01.459 --> 00:21:02.820
no rest for you.

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:07.379
Why did it stop glowing?

00:21:07.619 --> 00:21:09.139
Their blooming period is brief.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.100
It only lasts minutes.

00:21:12.340 --> 00:21:13.419
Nothing special to see.

00:21:18.219 --> 00:21:20.260
But it's quite wonderful.

00:21:32.859 --> 00:21:34.219
Are you kidding me?

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:36.540
Do you have to dress up
before seeing an old man?

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:38.980
You'll find out why later.

00:21:42.515 --> 00:21:52.704
(Huang Qi Residence)

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:55.659
Master, do you enjoy the massage?

00:21:57.379 --> 00:21:59.219
Master, do you enjoy the massage?

00:22:08.899 --> 00:22:10.659
You must be Master Huang Qi, right?

00:22:10.820 --> 00:22:11.820
No.

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:13.300
Don't speak to me.

00:22:13.619 --> 00:22:14.432
Old man.

00:22:14.432 --> 00:22:17.179
You're dressed like Huang Qi herbs.
Yet you're not Master Huang Qi?

00:22:17.179 --> 00:22:18.060
Nobody believes that.

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:18.899
You...

00:22:26.899 --> 00:22:27.540
Thank you.

00:22:34.547 --> 00:22:36.576
(I don't save handsome men.)

00:22:37.859 --> 00:22:38.899
What's so funny?

00:22:42.980 --> 00:22:44.859
It's a bit exaggerated.

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:46.740
My master once told me

00:22:46.780 --> 00:22:48.859
that Master Huang Qi
has a peculiar temper.

00:22:49.020 --> 00:22:51.020
He especially detests handsome men.

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:52.859
Someone as good-looking as Huan Zong

00:22:52.859 --> 00:22:54.419
would definitely displease him.

00:22:54.820 --> 00:22:55.899
However,

00:22:55.980 --> 00:22:57.580
someone adorable like me

00:22:57.619 --> 00:22:59.139
is welcomed everywhere.

00:23:04.219 --> 00:23:05.980
I'm Kong Hou from Yunhua Sect.

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:07.619
Greetings, Master Huang Qi.

00:23:10.100 --> 00:23:12.419
You're Kong Hou?

00:23:12.899 --> 00:23:14.179
You know me?

00:23:23.139 --> 00:23:25.419
Wang Tong mentioned you.

00:23:25.859 --> 00:23:27.740
You are indeed quite adorable.

00:23:32.540 --> 00:23:34.500
Master, you're very famous.

00:23:34.619 --> 00:23:36.580
Ever since I was young,

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:37.419
I've heard

00:23:37.419 --> 00:23:39.260
about your countless life-saving deeds.

00:23:39.260 --> 00:23:39.859
They say

00:23:39.859 --> 00:23:40.619
any patients

00:23:40.699 --> 00:23:42.859
who are gravely ill

00:23:42.859 --> 00:23:43.699
will recover

00:23:43.699 --> 00:23:45.340
after your treatment.

00:23:45.619 --> 00:23:46.419
Therefore,

00:23:46.419 --> 00:23:47.899
I'd like to ask you

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:49.179
to treat my friend.

00:23:49.300 --> 00:23:50.459
Flattery won't work.

00:23:50.459 --> 00:23:51.100
No way.

00:23:51.100 --> 00:23:51.780
I won't save him.

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:52.939
No way.

00:23:52.939 --> 00:23:54.300
I won't save him.

00:23:54.300 --> 00:23:55.139
No way.

00:23:55.699 --> 00:23:56.540
- No way.
- Master!

00:23:56.540 --> 00:23:57.379
No way.

00:23:57.659 --> 00:23:58.260
No way.

00:23:58.260 --> 00:23:58.820
Master.

00:23:58.859 --> 00:23:59.939
Please treat him.

00:23:59.939 --> 00:24:01.580
I won't save him.

00:24:01.699 --> 00:24:03.300
Please save him, Master.

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:04.899
Master, just examine him once.

00:24:05.020 --> 00:24:05.980
Saving a life

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:07.419
is a truly noble act.

00:24:07.419 --> 00:24:08.500
Look at how young he is,

00:24:08.500 --> 00:24:09.419
yet he is gravely ill.

00:24:09.419 --> 00:24:10.780
He hasn't even married yet.

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:11.780
What a pity!

00:24:11.780 --> 00:24:13.340
Don't be fooled by his good appearance

00:24:13.379 --> 00:24:14.260
and rosy complexion.

00:24:14.260 --> 00:24:15.340
It's all a facade.

00:24:15.419 --> 00:24:16.219
Truthfully,

00:24:16.219 --> 00:24:17.500
his vitality's nearly exhausted.

00:24:17.540 --> 00:24:18.899
Please save him.

00:24:19.179 --> 00:24:20.300
Master.

00:24:20.340 --> 00:24:21.379
Stop babbling.

00:24:21.500 --> 00:24:22.659
You're young

00:24:22.659 --> 00:24:23.619
yet so talkative.

00:24:23.619 --> 00:24:25.300
How can you be so thick-skinned?

00:24:26.500 --> 00:24:27.619
When traveling,

00:24:27.619 --> 00:24:29.699
thin skin won't get you far.

00:24:29.740 --> 00:24:30.419
Master.

00:24:30.580 --> 00:24:32.219
We admire your medical prowess

00:24:32.340 --> 00:24:34.419
and traveled great distances

00:24:34.540 --> 00:24:35.939
just to have you

00:24:36.060 --> 00:24:37.100
examine him once.

00:24:37.100 --> 00:24:38.419
No matter what you say,

00:24:39.859 --> 00:24:41.659
I won't save him.

00:24:43.560 --> 00:24:44.060
Master.

00:24:44.060 --> 00:24:45.379
How can you be like this?

00:24:45.379 --> 00:24:46.659
You can be handsome,

00:24:46.659 --> 00:24:48.179
but others can't be good-looking?

00:24:53.699 --> 00:24:55.020
You think

00:24:57.179 --> 00:24:58.379
I'm handsome?

00:25:00.859 --> 00:25:02.580
Of course, you are!

00:25:02.699 --> 00:25:04.939
Throughout the entire Lingyou Realm,

00:25:05.179 --> 00:25:06.219
you are

00:25:06.219 --> 00:25:07.540
the most handsome person.

00:25:07.619 --> 00:25:09.020
Even Master Wang Tong

00:25:09.020 --> 00:25:10.459
comes after you in looks.

00:25:10.500 --> 00:25:11.939
Let alone Huan Zong.

00:25:11.980 --> 00:25:12.980
Don't you agree?

00:25:14.619 --> 00:25:15.540
Wang Tong

00:25:15.540 --> 00:25:17.379
can't hold a candle to me.

00:25:18.899 --> 00:25:19.740
Considering you are

00:25:19.740 --> 00:25:20.939
his disciple,

00:25:21.340 --> 00:25:23.379
I'll grant your request.

00:25:24.780 --> 00:25:25.619
However,

00:25:25.699 --> 00:25:26.820
you must

00:25:26.899 --> 00:25:28.619
meet one condition.

00:25:29.459 --> 00:25:30.820
What is it?

00:25:35.459 --> 00:25:36.619
Hey, give me a hand.

00:25:40.899 --> 00:25:42.260
Lately, I've been

00:25:42.540 --> 00:25:44.060
developing a new medicinal formula.

00:25:44.260 --> 00:25:46.300
But it's missing one crucial

00:25:46.300 --> 00:25:47.899
catalyst ingredient.

00:25:48.540 --> 00:25:50.419
If you can find it for me,

00:25:50.419 --> 00:25:51.219
not many needed,

00:25:51.340 --> 00:25:52.340
just one,

00:25:52.500 --> 00:25:54.020
then I'll treat him.

00:25:57.820 --> 00:25:59.820
What's this precious ingredient?

00:26:12.139 --> 00:26:14.419
It's exceptionally rare

00:26:14.459 --> 00:26:16.100
to see it.

00:26:16.980 --> 00:26:17.980
Many physicians

00:26:17.980 --> 00:26:21.179
never encounter it
in their entire lives.

00:26:24.699 --> 00:26:25.980
It's called...

00:26:31.300 --> 00:26:32.419
Blue Silver Flower?

00:26:34.419 --> 00:26:36.100
How did you know its name?

00:26:36.659 --> 00:26:37.780
Not only do I know the name,

00:26:37.780 --> 00:26:39.100
I've got plenty!

00:26:43.219 --> 00:26:45.100
This flower smells rather nice.

00:26:45.379 --> 00:26:47.020
I'll pick some for Ling Hui

00:26:47.020 --> 00:26:48.020
to make scented powder.

00:26:48.139 --> 00:26:49.780
Is it edible?

00:26:50.419 --> 00:26:51.899
The fragrance is delightful.

00:26:51.980 --> 00:26:52.899
I can

00:26:52.899 --> 00:26:54.820
make flower pastries with it.

00:27:10.899 --> 00:27:12.340
How do you have so many?

00:27:12.659 --> 00:27:13.219
Well?

00:27:13.219 --> 00:27:14.020
Is this enough?

00:27:14.179 --> 00:27:15.500
- Sure!
- I'd like to keep some

00:27:15.500 --> 00:27:16.580
for Ling Hui.

00:27:16.659 --> 00:27:17.619
It's sufficient!

00:27:17.899 --> 00:27:18.540
From now on,

00:27:18.659 --> 00:27:20.219
if you are ill,

00:27:20.340 --> 00:27:21.540
just come to find me.

00:27:25.340 --> 00:27:27.699
Kong Hou is impressive.

00:27:45.740 --> 00:27:48.619
You said your name was Huan Zong.

00:27:48.939 --> 00:27:50.300
But in Lingyou Realm,

00:27:50.340 --> 00:27:52.100
only Master Zhong Xi of Liuguang Sect

00:27:52.659 --> 00:27:55.300
possesses such profound cultivation.

00:27:55.619 --> 00:27:56.780
To be frank,

00:27:57.139 --> 00:27:58.300
I'm Zhong Xi.

00:27:58.740 --> 00:27:59.699
Well...

00:28:11.419 --> 00:28:12.899
Please speak directly.

00:28:14.100 --> 00:28:16.939
After the poison
damaged your spiritual core

00:28:17.020 --> 00:28:18.659
and you activated spiritual energy,

00:28:18.780 --> 00:28:19.859
your current condition

00:28:19.859 --> 00:28:20.980
is extremely perilous.

00:28:21.260 --> 00:28:22.659
Yet your complexion suggests

00:28:22.659 --> 00:28:23.780
you've consumed

00:28:23.780 --> 00:28:25.780
some medicine
stabilizing your spiritual core.

00:28:28.500 --> 00:28:29.659
That day at the sect,

00:28:29.740 --> 00:28:30.699
my master gave me a vial

00:28:30.699 --> 00:28:31.820
of pills you made

00:28:32.060 --> 00:28:33.619
to temporarily suppress the toxins.

00:28:38.820 --> 00:28:40.219
This elixir

00:28:40.219 --> 00:28:41.260
can boost your energy.

00:28:41.300 --> 00:28:42.100
At best,

00:28:42.219 --> 00:28:42.899
it could only

00:28:42.899 --> 00:28:44.139
alleviate your pain.

00:28:44.500 --> 00:28:45.899
When I was injured,

00:28:46.379 --> 00:28:47.580
Kong Hou

00:28:47.659 --> 00:28:49.020
helped me regulate my energy.

00:28:49.179 --> 00:28:50.500
Energy regulation?

00:28:50.859 --> 00:28:52.100
Your spiritual core is damaged.

00:28:52.100 --> 00:28:53.379
What good does that do?

00:28:55.379 --> 00:28:57.699
After her energy regulation,

00:28:58.300 --> 00:29:00.100
I felt better.

00:29:00.459 --> 00:29:02.619
But I had a relapse.

00:29:03.020 --> 00:29:05.179
When Lin Hu attempted energy regulation,

00:29:05.219 --> 00:29:06.500
it proved ineffective.

00:29:07.060 --> 00:29:08.939
I initially suspected

00:29:09.699 --> 00:29:10.980
she wanted to drain

00:29:10.980 --> 00:29:11.939
my spiritual energy.

00:29:14.540 --> 00:29:15.659
I see.

00:29:15.699 --> 00:29:17.179
The one who was in Harmony Sync

00:29:17.179 --> 00:29:18.659
with Kong Hou

00:29:18.939 --> 00:29:20.300
is you.

00:29:20.379 --> 00:29:21.859
What's Harmony Sync?

00:29:23.100 --> 00:29:25.780
A rare cultivation state

00:29:25.859 --> 00:29:28.340
requiring perfect alignment.

00:29:28.459 --> 00:29:29.699
Two destined individuals,

00:29:29.740 --> 00:29:31.340
merely through contact,

00:29:31.340 --> 00:29:33.340
can absorb ambient spiritual energy.

00:29:33.340 --> 00:29:35.419
But with your high cultivation level,

00:29:35.659 --> 00:29:36.820
such meager spiritual energy

00:29:37.060 --> 00:29:38.740
went unnoticed by you.

00:29:39.219 --> 00:29:40.699
Destined individuals?

00:29:42.899 --> 00:29:44.100
What defines that?

00:29:44.580 --> 00:29:45.899
The Harmony Sync

00:29:46.060 --> 00:29:47.740
remains obscure to most.

00:29:47.820 --> 00:29:48.619
I only read a little

00:29:48.619 --> 00:29:49.780
in an ancient book

00:29:49.780 --> 00:29:51.020
by chance.

00:29:51.100 --> 00:29:52.340
Perhaps

00:29:52.459 --> 00:29:53.659
no one in this world

00:29:53.659 --> 00:29:55.179
will ever know how profound it is.

00:29:56.419 --> 00:29:57.459
In this world,

00:29:57.459 --> 00:29:59.419
there exist no two other people

00:29:59.740 --> 00:30:01.980
who could reach that cultivation level.

00:30:02.619 --> 00:30:03.859
I simply never imagined

00:30:04.139 --> 00:30:05.899
the Harmony Sync would also serve

00:30:05.899 --> 00:30:07.260
to stabilize your spiritual core.

00:30:07.659 --> 00:30:09.100
(So, that's how it is.)

00:30:11.219 --> 00:30:12.580
May I ask another question?

00:30:12.939 --> 00:30:14.179
How did you know Kong Hou

00:30:14.179 --> 00:30:15.379
and I could reach that level?

00:30:18.060 --> 00:30:20.100
It was Kong Hou's master

00:30:20.100 --> 00:30:20.859
who told me.

00:30:21.179 --> 00:30:22.060
That day,

00:30:22.100 --> 00:30:24.300
he sensed something weird

00:30:24.500 --> 00:30:25.820
and sent me a message.

00:30:26.139 --> 00:30:28.419
But Kong Hou

00:30:28.540 --> 00:30:29.659
is not strong mentally.

00:30:30.020 --> 00:30:32.139
After that, her spiritual energy surged.

00:30:32.139 --> 00:30:33.619
She endured three thunder strikes.

00:30:33.899 --> 00:30:35.219
During her trial,

00:30:35.340 --> 00:30:37.419
had they not protected her,

00:30:37.820 --> 00:30:40.859
Kong Hou wouldn't have survived.

00:30:40.899 --> 00:30:42.020
(So that's what happened.)

00:30:42.820 --> 00:30:43.939
I now understand

00:30:43.939 --> 00:30:46.020
the root of Kong Hou's condition.

00:30:46.939 --> 00:30:48.179
From this day forth,

00:30:48.500 --> 00:30:49.699
I shall never again

00:30:49.699 --> 00:30:50.980
let her regulate my energy.

00:30:54.500 --> 00:30:55.859
I possess

00:30:56.020 --> 00:30:57.699
excellent medical books.

00:30:58.020 --> 00:31:00.540
I need to study them thoroughly

00:31:00.740 --> 00:31:02.459
to devise a method

00:31:02.500 --> 00:31:04.060
to heal your spiritual core.

00:31:05.500 --> 00:31:06.980
Stay here while I'm in retreat

00:31:07.179 --> 00:31:09.179
for ten days.

00:31:09.340 --> 00:31:10.139
By the way,

00:31:10.699 --> 00:31:12.580
since you have nothing else to do,

00:31:12.699 --> 00:31:14.300
tend to the field

00:31:14.300 --> 00:31:15.939
outside my herb garden.

00:31:16.060 --> 00:31:16.899
Clear the weeds,

00:31:16.899 --> 00:31:19.260
so I may plant herbs later.

00:31:19.379 --> 00:31:20.179
Rest assured,

00:31:20.179 --> 00:31:21.580
we'll complete the task.

00:31:34.139 --> 00:31:36.580
Master Huang Qi

00:31:36.580 --> 00:31:37.899
must be a lazybones.

00:31:38.020 --> 00:31:39.340
This field is full of weeds.

00:31:39.379 --> 00:31:41.020
He's never cleared them, has he?

00:31:41.699 --> 00:31:42.899
We need his help.

00:31:43.179 --> 00:31:44.340
Doing chores is reasonable.

00:31:44.580 --> 00:31:45.500
But my back's breaking.

00:31:45.500 --> 00:31:47.340
I can't even stand straight.

00:31:47.379 --> 00:31:48.659
No one's rushing you.

00:31:48.699 --> 00:31:49.699
Take your time.

00:31:51.780 --> 00:31:53.020
I have an idea

00:31:53.020 --> 00:31:54.260
to clear all weeds

00:31:54.260 --> 00:31:55.619
without manual labor.

00:31:55.659 --> 00:31:56.980
We won't need to toil.

00:31:57.699 --> 00:31:58.780
What is it?

00:32:12.139 --> 00:32:12.740
Watch.

00:32:12.780 --> 00:32:13.820
Problem solved.

00:32:13.899 --> 00:32:15.060
Within an hour,

00:32:15.219 --> 00:32:17.899
we'll be finished.

00:32:18.260 --> 00:32:19.899
Truly, within an hour.

00:32:24.899 --> 00:32:25.899
The paddy field

00:32:25.980 --> 00:32:27.500
can be burning?

00:32:27.500 --> 00:32:28.020
Who told you

00:32:28.020 --> 00:32:29.139
water prevents fires?

00:32:29.619 --> 00:32:30.939
You used true fire, right?

00:32:31.340 --> 00:32:31.859
Well,

00:32:31.859 --> 00:32:33.340
how could I know?

00:32:33.419 --> 00:32:34.580
That was a tiny flame

00:32:34.580 --> 00:32:35.540
from Elder Qiu Shuang

00:32:35.540 --> 00:32:37.100
for forging.

00:32:37.139 --> 00:32:39.060
The true fire differs completely

00:32:39.060 --> 00:32:40.219
from earthly fire.

00:32:41.939 --> 00:32:42.980
What do we do now?

00:32:42.980 --> 00:32:44.419
Huan Zong, think of something!

00:32:44.659 --> 00:32:45.340
No solution.

00:32:45.580 --> 00:32:46.080
Well,

00:32:46.300 --> 00:32:48.020
when Master Huang Qi walks out

00:32:48.100 --> 00:32:49.379
and sees his field

00:32:49.379 --> 00:32:50.300
burnt out,

00:32:50.300 --> 00:32:52.020
he might refuse to help you.

00:32:52.139 --> 00:32:53.699
It's alright then.

00:32:53.980 --> 00:32:55.619
I'll find out another way.

00:33:23.699 --> 00:33:26.540
I can't believe it.

00:33:26.820 --> 00:33:27.699
There's no food

00:33:27.699 --> 00:33:29.100
anywhere!

00:33:29.699 --> 00:33:31.060
These cultivators

00:33:31.060 --> 00:33:33.419
develop a bad habit of fasting.

00:33:34.980 --> 00:33:36.260
I'm starving!

00:33:36.580 --> 00:33:38.260
I'm starving.

00:33:46.139 --> 00:33:47.100
(However,)

00:33:47.139 --> 00:33:48.540
(before a permanent cure,)

00:33:48.580 --> 00:33:49.939
(without Kong Hou's help)

00:33:49.980 --> 00:33:51.820
(with stabilizing your spiritual core,)

00:33:52.020 --> 00:33:54.740
(you will have a relapse.)

00:33:55.300 --> 00:33:56.139
(I can teach you)

00:33:56.139 --> 00:33:58.060
(how to suppress it
through self-regulation.)

00:33:58.260 --> 00:34:00.540
(But you will)

00:34:00.540 --> 00:34:02.260
(feel a lot of pain.)

00:34:02.699 --> 00:34:04.540
(You must consider carefully.)

00:34:19.980 --> 00:34:20.779
Huan Zong.

00:34:20.779 --> 00:34:21.779
Are you alright?

00:34:22.060 --> 00:34:22.819
Huan Zong.

00:34:23.739 --> 00:34:24.580
Huan Zong.

00:34:26.179 --> 00:34:27.580
Huan Zong, I'm coming in.

00:34:28.020 --> 00:34:28.739
Get out.

00:34:31.819 --> 00:34:33.540
Let me check on you inside.

00:34:34.980 --> 00:34:36.219
Huan Zong, I'm coming in!

00:34:40.020 --> 00:34:40.619
Huan Zong.

00:34:40.779 --> 00:34:41.860
What's happening to you?

00:34:41.940 --> 00:34:42.860
Is it serious?

00:34:42.860 --> 00:34:43.940
Let me help.

00:34:43.980 --> 00:34:46.580
(Kong Hou wouldn't have survived.)

00:34:46.580 --> 00:34:47.299
Leave.

00:34:47.460 --> 00:34:48.540
I won't go.

00:34:48.540 --> 00:34:49.659
Let me help.

00:34:51.659 --> 00:34:52.339
Huan Zong.

00:34:52.819 --> 00:34:53.699
Huan Zong.

00:34:55.380 --> 00:34:56.259
Huan Zong.

00:34:56.980 --> 00:34:58.339
Let me in!

00:35:00.739 --> 00:35:01.460
Wait!

00:35:02.900 --> 00:35:05.020
Lin Hu, wait a moment!

00:35:07.139 --> 00:35:09.179
What's wrong with your young master?

00:35:09.259 --> 00:35:10.299
He didn't let me in.

00:35:10.339 --> 00:35:11.580
What exactly happened?

00:35:13.299 --> 00:35:14.500
Speak!

00:35:16.139 --> 00:35:18.299
Master Huang Qi said

00:35:18.540 --> 00:35:19.739
my young master's illness

00:35:19.739 --> 00:35:21.420
hasn't fully healed yet.

00:35:21.540 --> 00:35:22.900
It could relapse at any moment.

00:35:22.980 --> 00:35:24.299
Helping him regulate energy

00:35:24.339 --> 00:35:26.219
may attract thunder strikes to you.

00:35:26.339 --> 00:35:27.100
So he has to

00:35:27.100 --> 00:35:28.380
regulate his energy himself.

00:35:28.420 --> 00:35:29.659
Meanwhile,

00:35:29.699 --> 00:35:31.179
he will feel a lot of pain.

00:35:31.339 --> 00:35:32.739
Has his condition

00:35:32.819 --> 00:35:34.339
worsened this much?

00:35:35.179 --> 00:35:36.619
What do we do now?

00:35:39.020 --> 00:35:39.779
Well...

00:35:41.299 --> 00:35:42.299
Kong Hou.

00:35:43.900 --> 00:35:44.659
Huan Zong.

00:35:44.980 --> 00:35:46.380
Huan Zong, open the door!

00:35:46.540 --> 00:35:47.179
Huan Zong.

00:35:47.219 --> 00:35:48.739
I need to see you.

00:35:49.020 --> 00:35:49.779
Huan Zong.

00:35:51.100 --> 00:35:51.980
Huan Zong.

00:35:52.619 --> 00:35:53.619
Huan Zong.

00:35:55.980 --> 00:35:57.020
Huan Zong.

00:36:14.460 --> 00:36:15.339
Huan Zong.

00:36:25.580 --> 00:36:26.299
Huan Zong.

00:36:26.619 --> 00:36:28.139
Why didn't you tell me?

00:36:29.580 --> 00:36:30.699
Answer me!

00:36:30.739 --> 00:36:32.420
Why keep this from me?

00:36:32.779 --> 00:36:34.259
Because I'm fine.

00:36:34.940 --> 00:36:35.739
Huan Zong.

00:36:36.299 --> 00:36:37.339
Let me help.

00:36:37.500 --> 00:36:38.699
Remember what your master

00:36:38.699 --> 00:36:39.540
taught you?

00:36:39.540 --> 00:36:40.580
I remember.

00:36:40.659 --> 00:36:41.819
But now you...

00:36:41.819 --> 00:36:42.619
No.

00:36:43.060 --> 00:36:44.699
Why can't we try?

00:36:44.900 --> 00:36:46.420
After I help regulate your energy,

00:36:46.540 --> 00:36:48.299
you can help improve my cultivation.

00:36:48.500 --> 00:36:49.860
Once my mental power improves,

00:36:49.900 --> 00:36:51.259
everything will be fine.

00:36:51.380 --> 00:36:52.900
Even if three thunder strikes

00:36:52.900 --> 00:36:54.460
come down,

00:36:54.500 --> 00:36:56.020
you'll be there to block them, right?

00:36:56.139 --> 00:36:57.819
You'll shield me then,

00:36:57.940 --> 00:36:58.580
okay?

00:37:07.580 --> 00:37:09.139
It's too risky

00:37:10.500 --> 00:37:11.779
for both of us.

00:37:13.619 --> 00:37:14.619
Huan Zong.

00:37:15.060 --> 00:37:17.100
Nobody knows what will happen to me.

00:37:17.179 --> 00:37:18.819
Don't you realize your current state...

00:37:21.659 --> 00:37:23.779
Your present condition matters most!

00:37:23.860 --> 00:37:25.299
Instead of worrying about future me,

00:37:25.299 --> 00:37:27.139
focus on your current condition!

00:37:28.699 --> 00:37:30.580
I said I'm fine.

00:37:31.460 --> 00:37:33.619
You are fine?

00:37:34.259 --> 00:37:36.020
You always claim you're fine.

00:37:36.580 --> 00:37:37.540
You really see yourself

00:37:37.540 --> 00:37:39.020
as an indestructible sword

00:37:39.179 --> 00:37:41.020
for vanquishing demons
and upholding justice?

00:37:45.940 --> 00:37:47.420
That is

00:37:49.179 --> 00:37:50.699
my duty.

00:37:51.779 --> 00:37:52.900
Huan Zong,

00:37:53.339 --> 00:37:55.179
you're a living person,

00:37:55.339 --> 00:37:56.659
not a blade,

00:37:56.739 --> 00:37:57.819
not a sword,

00:37:57.819 --> 00:37:59.299
nor a weapon!

00:37:59.900 --> 00:38:01.460
For the last time,

00:38:06.580 --> 00:38:07.819
this doesn't concern you.

00:38:07.940 --> 00:38:10.819
How could it not concern me?
How could I not care about you?

00:38:10.819 --> 00:38:12.100
- We're friends.
- Ten days later,

00:38:13.540 --> 00:38:14.900
Huang Qi will finish his retreat.

00:38:16.020 --> 00:38:18.299
Then, you and I

00:38:18.299 --> 00:38:19.619
will go our separate ways.

00:38:21.219 --> 00:38:22.699
Let's part ways here.

00:38:23.739 --> 00:38:24.580
Fine.

00:38:25.339 --> 00:38:26.699
Whatever.

00:38:27.139 --> 00:38:29.020
I don't care.

00:38:29.179 --> 00:38:30.259
Ten days later,

00:38:30.380 --> 00:38:31.699
let's part ways.

00:39:01.512 --> 00:39:04.079
♪Roaming with the wind♪

00:39:04.524 --> 00:39:06.835
♪Wandering about♪

00:39:07.287 --> 00:39:12.098
♪A final ember of warmth abides♪

00:39:13.232 --> 00:39:15.398
♪Absurd plots unfold♪

00:39:15.874 --> 00:39:18.388
♪Mere spectators♪

00:39:18.652 --> 00:39:23.182
♪Footprints left on shores♪

00:39:24.517 --> 00:39:26.940
♪Fickle kisses burn♪

00:39:27.213 --> 00:39:30.005
♪Withering in an instant♪

00:39:30.120 --> 00:39:34.904
♪Lanterns glow, depicting her grace♪

00:39:35.783 --> 00:39:38.315
♪Like rusted locks♪

00:39:38.683 --> 00:39:41.284
♪Chaining our memories♪

00:39:41.614 --> 00:39:46.576
♪Only scars remain♪

00:39:46.920 --> 00:39:49.588
♪Breaking from worldly desires♪

00:39:49.800 --> 00:39:52.506
♪Dreams shattered, but reality rolls on♪

00:39:52.616 --> 00:39:58.312
♪Letting down my guard,
drowning in the perilous love♪

00:39:58.312 --> 00:40:01.031
♪You stole my heart♪

00:40:01.160 --> 00:40:03.890
♪Vows scatter with the air♪

00:40:04.072 --> 00:40:09.395
♪All the wounds will heal with care♪

00:40:09.395 --> 00:40:12.754
♪Love is mystery♪

00:40:13.097 --> 00:40:15.671
♪So be it♪

00:40:15.784 --> 00:40:18.705
♪She blazes uncontrolled♪

00:40:18.917 --> 00:40:21.198
♪A sickness of the soul♪

00:40:21.198 --> 00:40:24.200
♪Cold nights take their toll♪

00:40:24.360 --> 00:40:26.792
♪So be it♪

00:40:27.042 --> 00:40:33.341
♪All efforts go unrewarded♪

00:40:35.348 --> 00:40:37.992
♪Breaking from worldly desires♪

00:40:38.500 --> 00:40:41.164
♪Dreams shattered, but reality rolls on♪

00:40:41.320 --> 00:40:46.950
♪Letting down my guard,
drowning in the perilous love♪

00:40:46.950 --> 00:40:49.567
♪You stole my heart♪

00:40:49.848 --> 00:40:52.429
♪Vows scatter with the air♪

00:40:52.616 --> 00:40:59.634
♪All the wounds will heal with care♪

00:41:01.416 --> 00:41:03.944
♪So be it♪